1"))(text "J4 pins 1/2/3 = K1 3.5 mm tip/ring/sleeve; pins 4/5/6 = 2.5 mm tip/ring/sleeve. Pin 5 unused." (at 30 157 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "0c5bd99d-1f43-46c8-a83e-ecb4d3487946"))(text "J6: 2.54 mm pitch, 1=5V, 2=audio IN, 3=GND, 4=GND. Matches amplifier VCC/IN/GND/GND order." (at 30 163 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "7f348174-90e7-45a1-841b-1d48668acfea"))(text "J8 receives capacitor-coupled speaker output. Pin 2 is optional common ground; return exists through J6." (at 30 169 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "1a700d7b-d54b-46fd-9caf-10dad657d530"))(text "PTT pull-ups are 10k to KB2040 3V output, never 5V. J5 and J7 retired in Rev B." (at 30 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "34a3591d-1a65-42d3-8dba-1c2260bb2866"))(text "J1 USB-A connects the sound adapter. J2/J3 connect its audio plugs. Shield bonded to GND." (at 30 181 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "e1a3ea12-469e-40cd-b50b-e8d89380cb90"))(text "Power through hub USB-C only. No second USB cable to installed KB2040. No 9V input." (at 30 187 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "bdce4265-be77-475e-9fe6-5af2949a0daf"))(text "Review USB signal integrity, current budget and actual mechanical fit before fabrication." (at 30 193 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "6d972ef2-6885-4d00-a273-261d400a8401")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))